<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Trade was at a standstill in the panhandle area late Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested at the close.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers following the weekly movement of 91,600 head.</p>
<p>Confirmed:     None     Week Ago: None    Year Ago:  2,000</p>
</text>
